Install Ceph CSI using Helm
Architecture
                 Kubernetes
                      │
                Helm Chart
                      │
        ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
        │                           │
 Provisioner Deployment      Node Plugin DaemonSet
        │                           │
        └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                      │
                 Ceph Cluster


Step 1 - Add the Helm Repository

First, let's see your current Helm repositories.

helm repo list

If the Ceph CSI repository isn't listed, add it:

helm repo add ceph-csi https://ceph.github.io/csi-charts

Update the repositories:

helm repo update

Verify:

helm search repo ceph-csi

Expected output should include something like:

ceph-csi/ceph-csi-rbd
ceph-csi/ceph-csi-cephfs


Step 2 - Download the default values

We never install a Helm chart without reviewing its values.

mkdir -p ~/ceph-csi-helm
cd ~/ceph-csi-helm

helm show values ceph-csi/ceph-csi-rbd > values.yaml

Verify:

ls -lh values.yaml
